  "description": "Heavenly Demon, Hunter, Giant Robot, Demon King, Superhuman.\n\nThe strongest figures from each world gather, staking the fate of their universes.\n\nIn a survival war where the only price of defeat is the destruction of their world, representatives of the 'Normal World', who possess absolutely no special abilities, are dragged into the fray.\n\nRight before being crushed by the overwhelming military might of out-of-spec monsters, an unexpected weapon is handed to them.\n\n[The abilities of your game character are synchronized.]\n\nCan Shin Jahyun and the representatives of the Normal World borrow the power of games to defeat the true powerhouses and survive?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854580), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14678368)",
